,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI完成110亿美元新一轮融资，公司估值达到1.25万亿美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta发布基于Muse Wonder训练的专用模型并全面接入Muse与Meta AI</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek开源智能体框架Harness日活突破154万，单日消耗92T词元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果Siri AI全面控制应用功能延期至2027年春季上线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d0caae9a70c7ea4f765052ff3020b651.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司近期调整人工智能战略，原定于iOS 27系列更新中推出的Siri AI全面跨应用控制功能，现已延期至2027年春季，预计将随iOS 27.5或27.6版本以预览形式发布。目前，iOS 27.3开发者测试版仅支持Siri处理部分基础第一方应用任务。苹果正通过App Intents框架加速开发，旨在实现无需全程监督的长期任务助手，但在任务复杂度和自主性方面，相较于Muse、Grok等竞品仍存在差距。此次延期反映了在操作系统底层深度整合生成式AI的技术复杂性，如何在保障隐私与安全的前提下实现高自主性的跨应用调度，成为苹果当前面临的核心挑战。该调整意味着用户体验更高级的自主AI特性及第三方应用深度支持还需等待更长周期。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美国中期选举后民主党拟限制AI开发与数据中心建设致美股大跌</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b63716592d5621db1087eea721823df8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国中期选举后，纳斯达克指数单日暴跌5.52%，创18个月最大跌幅，市值蒸发约2万亿至2.5万亿美元，英伟达股价单日下挫9%。此次崩盘源于民主党夺回参众两院后，明确提出暂停前沿AI开发并限制新建超过20兆瓦的大型数据中心。受此政策预期影响，存储、核电及电力板块集体走弱。此前，全美最大电网PJM容量拍卖价一年内暴涨833%，加之数据中心带来的环境与就业矛盾，促使选民支持“暂停AI大基建”政策。高盛警告约45%的数据中心扩容项目受波及，瑞银测算至2028年约30%的新增算力面临搁浅风险。得州、佐治亚州及俄亥俄州作为全美三分之一规划算力的所在地，其政策转向将直接冲击AI基础设施的扩张进程，华尔街对AI驱动的增长逻辑产生严重动摇。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI完成110亿美元新一轮融资，公司估值达到1.25万亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8bcc90ae280ae1fccd3afc68edf3fc9b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI在新一轮融资中成功筹集110亿美元，公司估值已达1.25万亿美元。该笔资金属于更大规模融资计划的一部分，预计未来几周内最终总额有望达到200亿美元。此前9月下旬市场曾传出300亿美元的融资目标，此次实际金额显示出一定程度的预期回调。当前人工智能一级市场正面临阶段性调整，竞争对手Anthropic的估值近期出现显著下滑。在宏观环境趋紧、美国政坛格局变化及数据中心布局审慎的背景下，OpenAI本轮融资凸显了头部大模型企业对算力与研发资本的强劲吸纳能力。随着IPO筹备进程推进，资本市场对AI独角兽的估值逻辑已从早期的扩张转向关注商业化落地与抗风险能力，这将深刻影响未来AI行业的资源分配与竞争格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta发布基于Muse Wonder训练的专用模型并全面接入Muse与Meta AI</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/389552366f83b75ea62f8fb7e39a333d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月6日，Meta正式将基于Muse Wonder大模型训练的系列专用模型推向Muse与Meta AI。在“个人超级智能指数”测试中，新模型得分从38%提升至47%。此次升级核心引入“主动记忆”与“主动聚焦”功能：主动记忆使模型具备跨时间深度推理能力，关键上下文正确使用率达90%，遗忘关键信息的错误率降低2.4倍；主动聚焦则针对任务瓶颈优化，在处理易出错任务时表现提升67%。针对不同产品，Muse模型强化了多任务处理与协作能力，Meta AI模型则提升了复杂问题拆解与实时对话跟进能力。此次技术下放旨在通过长效记忆与自主任务聚焦能力，显著提升AI在日常对话及复杂任务处理中的表现，为用户提供更具智能的交互体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek开源智能体框架Harness日活突破154万，单日消耗92T词元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/31ad7bf053179e7d293d02d25e43572c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek旗下开源智能体应用框架Harness上线不到三月，官方API日活跃用户数（DAU）已达154万，较9月30日桌面版发布后的7日均值271K实现显著增长。随着用户规模爆发，平台单日大模型词元消耗量飙升至92T，平均每用户日均消耗约6000万词元，凸显了长时智能体任务对算力资源的巨大需求。Harness采用极致插件化架构，目前生态内已构建约3.5万个自定义插件，约60%活跃用户参与过插件制作。为进一步巩固生态，DeepSeek计划推出官方插件市场，并启动包含词元补贴、技术支持及流量推广的创作者激励计划。此举旨在通过生态丰富度提升竞争力，在模型价格优势之外，正式向OpenAI和Anthropic等头部厂商发起正面竞争。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
